  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-57-92"><seg source="#source-57-92">このみちの醸すがごとく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-92-127"><seg source="#source-92-127">粟葉などひかりいでしは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-127-159"><seg source="#source-127-159">ひがしなる山彙の上に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-159-196"><seg source="#source-159-196">黄なる月いざよへるなり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-196-225"><seg source="#source-196-225">夏の草山とになひて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-225-257"><seg source="#source-225-257">やうやくに人ら帰るを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-257-295"><seg source="#source-257-295">なにをかもわがかなしまん</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-295-328"><seg source="#source-295-328">すゝきの葉露をおとせり</seg></p>
    </body>
